Request: birthday list with calendar reminders

The section must do:
- adds a yearly recurring calendar event on that birthday at 9:00 AM, with an alert the set number of days before (a birthday is added)

The person sets these on the screen and nothing else uses them yet; the section uses them:
- "Remind me before": state.reminderLeadDays

The program already has these: use them, do not make your own:
- a list of entries: state.entries is LogEntry[] with the fields {personName: string, birthday: number, minute: number}. Its form, its Add and Remove buttons and its rows are already on the screen. The section makes no list of its own for the same entries; to add one it copies state.entries into a new array, pushes a LogEntry (minute: time.hourOfDay() * 60 + time.minuteOfHour()) and returns {entries: thatArray __PASSTHROUGH__}.

Nothing they show is shown again: no second list, total, chart, Remove last or Start over button. While what the section works from is still empty, it shows one plain line saying what will appear and when, never a ui.EmptyState: the list above already has one (two empty states one under the other read as a broken screen).

